1281
01:18:07.291 --> 01:18:11.125
<i>Ah, just... If just one of them
could say, "I'm sorry,"</i>

1282
01:18:11.916 --> 01:18:13.833
<i>you know, and mean it.</i>

1283
01:18:14.375 --> 01:18:16.583
<i>Or go to jail.</i>

1284
01:18:17.208 --> 01:18:20.250
<i>Or both. Yeah. Hey, that would be nice.</i>

1285
01:18:20.333 --> 01:18:21.833
<i>How about both?</i>

1286
01:18:31.625 --> 01:18:33.375
Oh...

1287
01:18:35.166 --> 01:18:36.166
Yeah?

1288
01:19:32.833 --> 01:19:36.083
<i>A lot of it's legal,
but that's exactly the problem.</i>

1289
01:19:37.125 --> 01:19:40.375
<i>It's not that they're breaking the laws,
it's that the laws are so poorly designed</i>

1290
01:19:40.458 --> 01:19:43.083
<i>that they allow people,
if they've got enough lawyers</i>

1291
01:19:43.166 --> 01:19:46.708
<i>and enough accountants,
to wiggle out of responsibilities</i>

1292
01:19:46.791 --> 01:19:50.166
<i>that ordinary citizens
are having to abide by.</i>

1293
01:19:50.250 --> 01:19:54.041
<i>We turn now to the banking bombshell
causing shock waves around the world,</i>

1294
01:19:54.125 --> 01:19:56.000
<i>the so-called "Panama Papers",</i>

1295
01:19:56.083 --> 01:19:58.583
<i>believed to be the biggest data leak
in history.</i>

1296
01:19:58.666 --> 01:20:02.416
<i>Iceland's Prime Minster has stepped down
